OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FThe evening
OL,6,Fwill be mostly dry with only a small
OL,7,Fchance of the odd light shower. The
OL,8,Fnight will then continue dry with
OL,9,Fincreasing clear periods.
OL,10,
OL,11,CSunday:FDry with bright or sunny
OL,12,Fspells in the morning. The afternoon
OL,13,Fwill stay dry but sunshine turning
OL,14,Fmore hazy as cloud spreads east.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
