OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:
OL,6,FOutbreaks of locally heavy rain spread
OL,7,Feast on Monday. Bright spells and
OL,8,Fscattered, occasionally heavy, showers
OL,9,Fon Tuesday. Showers gradually fade
OL,10,FWednesday morning, then rain spreads
OL,11,Feast later.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
